	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Accepi, venerandissime domine, quae ultimo misisti, proque <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>iis gratias ago.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> aut aliunde nihil hab<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>emus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Legatus nihil (ut ex suis audio) habet certi.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Diversissima dicunt milites, qui revertuntur; di<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>cuntur ex ultimis quosdam etiam adesse.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Mirum de <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>commisso proelio nihil certi affirmari.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Literae nudius<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>tertius civi cuidam nostro <placeName ref="l473">Sanctogallo</placeName> a quodam mercato<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>re missae sunt, quarum argumentum est ulti<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>mos milites prope omnes trucidatos esse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quid <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>verum sit, nimirum iam scitis ipsi; mercato<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>res enim nostri retulerunt die Veneris post <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>discessum eorum demum literas ad magistratum vestrum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>amplissimum nescio unde allatas esse, quas ipsi, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>quid contineant, non potuerint exspectare.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Interpres <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>noster, homo versipellis et os impudens, fingit haec <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>omnia de <placeName ref="l167">Genevensibus</placeName>, audit ex aliis atque omnia <lb xml:id="p1z18"/><placeName ref="l167">Genevam</placeName> dare existimat.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Sed cautior ero posthac <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>neque cuiquam ullum exemplum dabo exscribendum.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>D. consul retinet diu, si quid mitto; sed et alius legato <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>plus nimium favet, nec facile haec, quae vel fidissimis <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>distribuuntur, taceri possunt.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Nescio, cui fidam tandem.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Si ipsi nanciscantur aliquid, quod e re sua esse arbitrantur, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>plenis buccis, non scriptis modo publicant et dispergunt.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>D. <persName ref="p464">Brunnerus</persName> vivit <placeName ref="l305">Meyenfeldae</placeName>, nescio quam bene; nunquam en<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>im inde ad me scripsit.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Remitto hoc scriptum <placeName ref="l28">Basiliense</placeName> atque gratias ago maximas.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Deus optimus maximus te <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>nobis omnibus quam diutissime conservet incolumem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curiae</placeName> 1568. 19. ianuarii ocyus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Tuae di<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>gnitati subiectissimus <persName ref="p8016">Th[obias] Eg[lius</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Resalutant te ex singulari mandato omnes, consules, d. <persName ref="p1770">Ca<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>rolus</persName>, vir strenuus, d. <persName ref="p6130">Pontisella</persName>, d. <persName ref="p20473">Gantnerus</persName> et filius d. <persName>Ambrosii Ambrosius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Der huͦbmeister von <placeName ref="l2582">Veldkirch</placeName> i<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>st diser wochen zhof hie g<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ewesenn und sampt anderen mitt dem bischof gässen, da ouch gsin unser <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>tütsch schuͦlmeister, ein erlicher man.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Alda der huͦbmeister die religion anz<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>ogenn unnd die ev[angelischen] gar zuͦ grob antastet: wir sygend all nüt den ver<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>dampt, heilos, schantlich lumpenlüt, die dem bös<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>en bald in h. etc.; ouch <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> mitt namen bnamset etc. gar z'grob.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de">Episcopus <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>hatt inn woll ein <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>klein gsteübt, <foreign xml:lang="la">et ludimagister</foreign> ist mitt imm <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>uneins worden.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Sed crastino discessit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Amplissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, ec<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>clesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> parocho vigilantis<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>simo, domino suo colendissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
